{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40871541410,"job_title":"llm影视翻配-中英","company_name":"江苏成功企业管理有限公司苏州分公司","industry":"人力资源","location":"北京 海淀 学院路","salary_min":"10001","salary_max":"14000","experience":"1-3年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-30 14:25:11","jd_text":"【职位描述】 \n \n 1、搭建具有通用性和可拓展性的翻译标注框架（英文、多语种），与算法团队对齐标准、撰写相关培训方案，根据模型迭代方向提供高质量数据； \n \n 2、负责大语言模型训练过程中各阶段数据生产，对自动化链路搭建、数据质量评估及外部资源管理负责，确保大语言模型训练数据有效； \n \n 3、能通过PE、代码完成数据预处理、分析和清洗，按照训练需求进行标注、分析和验证调优，提升模型效果； \n \n 4、与产品算法团队协同，积极探索自动化数据生产、数据合成等方法，提高数据标注效率，持续跟踪大模型技术进展，持续探索智能高效的数据生产模式。 \n \n \n \n \n 【职位要求】 \n \n 1、本科及以上学历，研究生优先，翻译，应用语言学，计算语言学； \n \n 2、具备英文能力，专八/雅思7分及以上【必须】 \n \n 3、具备项目管理或交付能力，有本地化项目管理经验或数据生产项目交付经验（不接受应届生） \n \n 3、具备良好的数据分析能力，善于提炼关键信息，有产品思维，善于从用户角度解决问题 \n \n 4、希望具备出色的PE能力，能够独立设计Prompt策略形成工作流，提高数据生产的质量和效率；【非必须】 \n \n 5、对大模型、数据领域有深刻的理解和认知，具备大模型应用落地相关工作经验，有Agent搭建经验优先。【非必须】","responsibilities":["【职位描述】","1、搭建具有通用性和可拓展性的翻译标注框架（英文、多语种），与算法团队对齐标准、撰写相关培训方案，根据模型迭代方向提供高质量数据；","2、负责大语言模型训练过程中各阶段数据生产，对自动化链路搭建、数据质量评估及外部资源管理负责，确保大语言模型训练数据有效；","3、能通过PE、代码完成数据预处理、分析和清洗，按照训练需求进行标注、分析和验证调优，提升模型效果；","4、与产品算法团队协同，积极探索自动化数据生产、数据合成等方法，提高数据标注效率，持续跟踪大模型技术进展，持续探索智能高效的数据生产模式。","【职位要求】","1、本科及以上学历，研究生优先，翻译，应用语言学，计算语言学；","2、具备英文能力，专八/雅思7分及以上【必须】","3、具备项目管理或交付能力，有本地化项目管理经验或数据生产项目交付经验（不接受应届生）","3、具备良好的数据分析能力，善于提炼关键信息，有产品思维，善于从用户角度解决问题","4、希望具备出色的PE能力，能够独立设计Prompt策略形成工作流，提高数据生产的质量和效率；【非必须】","5、对大模型、数据领域有深刻的理解和认知，具备大模型应用落地相关工作经验，有Agent搭建经验优先。【非必须】"],"requirements":["【职位描述】","1、搭建具有通用性和可拓展性的翻译标注框架（英文、多语种），与算法团队对齐标准、撰写相关培训方案，根据模型迭代方向提供高质量数据；","2、负责大语言模型训练过程中各阶段数据生产，对自动化链路搭建、数据质量评估及外部资源管理负责，确保大语言模型训练数据有效；","3、能通过PE、代码完成数据预处理、分析和清洗，按照训练需求进行标注、分析和验证调优，提升模型效果；","4、与产品算法团队协同，积极探索自动化数据生产、数据合成等方法，提高数据标注效率，持续跟踪大模型技术进展，持续探索智能高效的数据生产模式。","【职位要求】","1、本科及以上学历，研究生优先，翻译，应用语言学，计算语言学；","2、具备英文能力，专八/雅思7分及以上【必须】","3、具备项目管理或交付能力，有本地化项目管理经验或数据生产项目交付经验（不接受应届生）","3、具备良好的数据分析能力，善于提炼关键信息，有产品思维，善于从用户角度解决问题","4、希望具备出色的PE能力，能够独立设计Prompt策略形成工作流，提高数据生产的质量和效率；【非必须】","5、对大模型、数据领域有深刻的理解和认知，具备大模型应用落地相关工作经验，有Agent搭建经验优先。【非必须】"],"skills_raw":["口译","同声传译","英语专业八级","IELTS/雅思","雅思7.0分","雅思7.5分","雅思8.0分","本科","1-3年","人工智能"],"skills_norm":["口译","同声传译","英语专业八级","IELTS/雅思","雅思7.0分","雅思7.5分","雅思8.0分","本科","1-3年","人工智能"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CCL1212490300J40871541410.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40872983614,"job_title":"LLM应用工程师","company_name":"北京航星传动科技有限公司","industry":"船舶/航空/航天/军工","location":"北京 通州 马驹桥","salary_min":"7001","salary_max":"14000","experience":"经验不限","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-07-01 19:15:59","jd_text":"岗位职责\n1.参与业务Agent、问答助手、语义问数等应用场景的开发与测试。\n2.参与企业内部系统、数据库、知识库和工具接口的接入与联调。\n3.参与Prompt调整、结果验证、缺陷修复和版本迭代。\n4.参与开发文档、场景模板和复用组件整理，配合开展问题排查和效果优化。\n任职资格\n1.本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、人工智能等相关专业。\n2.Python基础扎实，具备数据库、SQL、接口调用等基本能力。\n3.至少参与过1个完整项目、实习项目、实验室课题或竞赛项目。\n4.对大模型、Agent、RAG、知识库应用等方向有明确兴趣，并愿意持续学习。\n5.具备较好的逻辑思维能力、执行能力和团队协作意识。\n6.有FastAPI、Git、Docker、问答系统或AI应用项目经历者优先。","responsibilities":["岗位职责","1.参与业务Agent、问答助手、语义问数等应用场景的开发与测试。","2.参与企业内部系统、数据库、知识库和工具接口的接入与联调。","3.参与Prompt调整、结果验证、缺陷修复和版本迭代。","4.参与开发文档、场景模板和复用组件整理，配合开展问题排查和效果优化。","任职资格","1.本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、人工智能等相关专业。","2.Python基础扎实，具备数据库、SQL、接口调用等基本能力。","3.至少参与过1个完整项目、实习项目、实验室课题或竞赛项目。","4.对大模型、Agent、RAG、知识库应用等方向有明确兴趣，并愿意持续学习。","5.具备较好的逻辑思维能力、执行能力和团队协作意识。","6.有FastAPI、Git、Docker、问答系统或AI应用项目经历者优先。"],"requirements":["岗位职责","1.参与业务Agent、问答助手、语义问数等应用场景的开发与测试。","2.参与企业内部系统、数据库、知识库和工具接口的接入与联调。","3.参与Prompt调整、结果验证、缺陷修复和版本迭代。","4.参与开发文档、场景模板和复用组件整理，配合开展问题排查和效果优化。","任职资格","1.本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、人工智能等相关专业。","2.Python基础扎实，具备数据库、SQL、接口调用等基本能力。","3.至少参与过1个完整项目、实习项目、实验室课题或竞赛项目。","4.对大模型、Agent、RAG、知识库应用等方向有明确兴趣，并愿意持续学习。","5.具备较好的逻辑思维能力、执行能力和团队协作意识。","6.有FastAPI、Git、Docker、问答系统或AI应用项目经历者优先。"],"skills_raw":["本科","船舶/航空/航天/军工"],"skills_norm":["本科","船舶/航空/航天/军工"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CCL1381662310J40872983614.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":41015889504,"job_title":"LLM大模型应用开发工程师-司机智能面试方向","company_name":"北京宏诚伟信人力资源管理服务有限公司","industry":"人力资源","location":"北京 丰台 太平桥","salary_min":"18001","salary_max":"28000","experience":"1-3年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-16 13:48:29","jd_text":"岗位：大模型应用开发工程师\n需求：宏诚伟信人力资源集团\n地点：北京丰台区国投财富广场1号楼17层，交通：9号线北京西站，或7号线湾子站出\n公司简介：\n我们是一家4A级人力资源集团公司，业务覆盖全国政企商务用车、高端出行服务等板块，致力于打造行业标杆级的商务车队服务体系。\n 注意：PYTHON +大模型、LLM,智能面试，出行风控，RAG \n \n 大模型应用开发工程师（AI 面试核心岗） \n岗位概述： \n基于豆包大模型打造驾驶员专属智能面试引擎，将公司多年驾驶员招聘经验转化为可落地的 AI 能力，覆盖 Prompt 体系设计、对话流程编排、语音链路打通、智能评分引擎开发，持续优化 AI 面试的专业度与准确率。 \n注意：大模型对话+风控建模+工程部署 \n核心职责： \n1.深度对接豆包大模型 API，封装统一的对话服务，实现上下文管理、Token 优化、流式输出、异常兜底、并发控制等基础能力。 \n2.深度梳理驾驶员招聘的考察维度、题库体系、评分标准、追问逻辑，设计并持续迭代面试场景的专属 Prompt 体系，保障 AI 面试的专业性与业务匹配度。 \n3.对接 ASR（语音转文字）、TTS（文字转语音）服务，打通「候选人语音输入→大模型理解应答→语音输出」的全链路语音交互，优化对话流畅度与识别准确率。 \n4.设计并开发智能评分引擎，将大模型对话输出转化为结构化多维度面试评分报告（安全意识、驾驶经验、服务意识、合规认知等）。 \n5.设计 AI 面试流程编排逻辑：根据候选人回答质量自动调整问题深度、识别答非所问并引导、异常场景兜底、触发面试终止条件。 \n6.沉淀面试语料库与效果评估体系，持续优化 Prompt、评分规则与对话逻辑，提升 AI 面试的业务价值。 \n7.配合后端团队完成 AI 服务与业务系统的接口对接，保障服务稳定性。 \n任职要求： \n1. 统招本科及以上学历，机器学习，人工智能，数据科学与大数据技术等专业优先 ； 2 年及以上大模型应用开发 / AI 产品开发相关经验，有完整的大模型落地项目经验。 \n2. 精通 Prompt Engineering 方法论，熟练掌握角色设定、Few-Shot、思维链、指令约束等优化技巧，能独立完成复杂业务场景的 Prompt 体系设计 \n熟练掌握 Python/Java/Node.js 至少一种后端开发语言，能独立完成 AI 服务端的逻辑开发与接口封装。 \n3. 具备良好的业务理解能力，能快速消化招聘行业、驾驶员岗位的业务规则，并转化为 AI 可落地的逻辑。 \n4.具备良好的问题排查与迭代优化能力，能通过数据分析定位 AI 效果问题并持续优化。 \n加分项 \n1.有 AI 面试、智能招聘、智能客服、数字人对话类项目落地经验。 \n2.有对接豆包 / 文心一言 / 通义千问等国内大模型 API 的实际项目经验。 \n3.熟悉主流云厂商的 ASR、TTS 语音服务，有语音交互全链路开发经验。 \n4.了解 RAG、Agent 相关技术，有智能体开发经验。 \n5.有人力资源、招聘行业相关工作经验。","responsibilities":["岗位：大模型应用开发工程师","需求：宏诚伟信人力资源集团","地点：北京丰台区国投财富广场1号楼17层，交通：9号线北京西站，或7号线湾子站出","公司简介：","我们是一家4A级人力资源集团公司，业务覆盖全国政企商务用车、高端出行服务等板块，致力于打造行业标杆级的商务车队服务体系。","注意：PYTHON +大模型、LLM,智能面试，出行风控，RAG","大模型应用开发工程师（AI 面试核心岗）","岗位概述：","基于豆包大模型打造驾驶员专属智能面试引擎，将公司多年驾驶员招聘经验转化为可落地的 AI 能力，覆盖 Prompt 体系设计、对话流程编排、语音链路打通、智能评分引擎开发，持续优化 AI 面试的专业度与准确率。","注意：大模型对话+风控建模+工程部署","核心职责：","1.深度对接豆包大模型 API，封装统一的对话服务，实现上下文管理、Token 优化、流式输出、异常兜底、并发控制等基础能力。","2.深度梳理驾驶员招聘的考察维度、题库体系、评分标准、追问逻辑，设计并持续迭代面试场景的专属 Prompt 体系，保障 AI 面试的专业性与业务匹配度。","3.对接 ASR（语音转文字）、TTS（文字转语音）服务，打通「候选人语音输入→大模型理解应答→语音输出」的全链路语音交互，优化对话流畅度与识别准确率。","4.设计并开发智能评分引擎，将大模型对话输出转化为结构化多维度面试评分报告（安全意识、驾驶经验、服务意识、合规认知等）。","5.设计 AI 面试流程编排逻辑：根据候选人回答质量自动调整问题深度、识别答非所问并引导、异常场景兜底、触发面试终止条件。","6.沉淀面试语料库与效果评估体系，持续优化 Prompt、评分规则与对话逻辑，提升 AI 面试的业务价值。","7.配合后端团队完成 AI 服务与业务系统的接口对接，保障服务稳定性。","任职要求：","1. 统招本科及以上学历，机器学习，人工智能，数据科学与大数据技术等专业优先 ； 2 年及以上大模型应用开发 / AI 产品开发相关经验，有完整的大模型落地项目经验。","2. 精通 Prompt Engineering 方法论，熟练掌握角色设定、Few-Shot、思维链、指令约束等优化技巧，能独立完成复杂业务场景的 Prompt 体系设计","熟练掌握 Python/Java/Node.js 至少一种后端开发语言，能独立完成 AI 服务端的逻辑开发与接口封装。","3. 具备良好的业务理解能力，能快速消化招聘行业、驾驶员岗位的业务规则，并转化为 AI 可落地的逻辑。","4.具备良好的问题排查与迭代优化能力，能通过数据分析定位 AI 效果问题并持续优化。","加分项","1.有 AI 面试、智能招聘、智能客服、数字人对话类项目落地经验。","2.有对接豆包 / 文心一言 / 通义千问等国内大模型 API 的实际项目经验。","3.熟悉主流云厂商的 ASR、TTS 语音服务，有语音交互全链路开发经验。","4.了解 RAG、Agent 相关技术，有智能体开发经验。","5.有人力资源、招聘行业相关工作经验。"],"requirements":["岗位：大模型应用开发工程师","需求：宏诚伟信人力资源集团","地点：北京丰台区国投财富广场1号楼17层，交通：9号线北京西站，或7号线湾子站出","公司简介：","我们是一家4A级人力资源集团公司，业务覆盖全国政企商务用车、高端出行服务等板块，致力于打造行业标杆级的商务车队服务体系。","注意：PYTHON +大模型、LLM,智能面试，出行风控，RAG","大模型应用开发工程师（AI 面试核心岗）","岗位概述：","基于豆包大模型打造驾驶员专属智能面试引擎，将公司多年驾驶员招聘经验转化为可落地的 AI 能力，覆盖 Prompt 体系设计、对话流程编排、语音链路打通、智能评分引擎开发，持续优化 AI 面试的专业度与准确率。","注意：大模型对话+风控建模+工程部署","核心职责：","1.深度对接豆包大模型 API，封装统一的对话服务，实现上下文管理、Token 优化、流式输出、异常兜底、并发控制等基础能力。","2.深度梳理驾驶员招聘的考察维度、题库体系、评分标准、追问逻辑，设计并持续迭代面试场景的专属 Prompt 体系，保障 AI 面试的专业性与业务匹配度。","3.对接 ASR（语音转文字）、TTS（文字转语音）服务，打通「候选人语音输入→大模型理解应答→语音输出」的全链路语音交互，优化对话流畅度与识别准确率。","4.设计并开发智能评分引擎，将大模型对话输出转化为结构化多维度面试评分报告（安全意识、驾驶经验、服务意识、合规认知等）。","5.设计 AI 面试流程编排逻辑：根据候选人回答质量自动调整问题深度、识别答非所问并引导、异常场景兜底、触发面试终止条件。","6.沉淀面试语料库与效果评估体系，持续优化 Prompt、评分规则与对话逻辑，提升 AI 面试的业务价值。","7.配合后端团队完成 AI 服务与业务系统的接口对接，保障服务稳定性。","任职要求：","1. 统招本科及以上学历，机器学习，人工智能，数据科学与大数据技术等专业优先 ； 2 年及以上大模型应用开发 / AI 产品开发相关经验，有完整的大模型落地项目经验。","2. 精通 Prompt Engineering 方法论，熟练掌握角色设定、Few-Shot、思维链、指令约束等优化技巧，能独立完成复杂业务场景的 Prompt 体系设计","熟练掌握 Python/Java/Node.js 至少一种后端开发语言，能独立完成 AI 服务端的逻辑开发与接口封装。","3. 具备良好的业务理解能力，能快速消化招聘行业、驾驶员岗位的业务规则，并转化为 AI 可落地的逻辑。","4.具备良好的问题排查与迭代优化能力，能通过数据分析定位 AI 效果问题并持续优化。","加分项","1.有 AI 面试、智能招聘、智能客服、数字人对话类项目落地经验。","2.有对接豆包 / 文心一言 / 通义千问等国内大模型 API 的实际项目经验。","3.熟悉主流云厂商的 ASR、TTS 语音服务，有语音交互全链路开发经验。","4.了解 RAG、Agent 相关技术，有智能体开发经验。","5.有人力资源、招聘行业相关工作经验。"],"skills_raw":["语义分析","情感分析","文本分类","篇章分析","信息抽取","Python","聊天机器人","主题模型","本科","1-3年","人力资源","人工智能","客运服务"],"skills_norm":["语义分析","情感分析","文本分类","篇章分析","信息抽取","Python","聊天机器人","主题模型","本科","1-3年","人力资源","人工智能","客运服务"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC687092280J41015889504.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40874831105,"job_title":"LLM评测(驻场）","company_name":"北京捷科智诚科技有限公司上海分公司","industry":"软件/IT服务","location":"北京 朝阳","salary_min":"12001","salary_max":"20000","experience":"1年以下","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-15 18:33:09","jd_text":"学信网可查本科及以上学历；法学专业，得有半年及以上相关工作经验\n岗位职责：\n需要有半年以上法律相关经验\n工作职责：\n核心职能：协助法律项目管理，自主研究法律相关新的评测方法、理论，定期产出行业观察报告。协助科技伦理项目管理，自主研究科技伦理新的数据集构建方法，理论，定期产出行业观察报告。\n 协作职能：其他项目协作事宜。\n人员画像：（结合项目实际需求，填写必须的画像要求，无明确要求的可填“xxxx优先”或“不限”，如有特殊要求请增加备注说明）1. 会写评测分析和评测报告\n2. 有数据分析、数据拆分、数据处理能力，能看懂基础代码者优先；会用设计软件/抠图软件者优先；\n3. 1年及以上的大模型相关的评测工作经验，善于团队合作沟通；可独立完成多模态视频、图片评测分析\n4. 抗压力强","responsibilities":["学信网可查本科及以上学历；法学专业，得有半年及以上相关工作经验","岗位职责：","需要有半年以上法律相关经验","工作职责：","核心职能：协助法律项目管理，自主研究法律相关新的评测方法、理论，定期产出行业观察报告。协助科技伦理项目管理，自主研究科技伦理新的数据集构建方法，理论，定期产出行业观察报告。","协作职能：其他项目协作事宜。","人员画像：（结合项目实际需求，填写必须的画像要求，无明确要求的可填“xxxx优先”或“不限”，如有特殊要求请增加备注说明）1. 会写评测分析和评测报告","2. 有数据分析、数据拆分、数据处理能力，能看懂基础代码者优先；会用设计软件/抠图软件者优先；","3. 1年及以上的大模型相关的评测工作经验，善于团队合作沟通；可独立完成多模态视频、图片评测分析","4. 抗压力强"],"requirements":["学信网可查本科及以上学历；法学专业，得有半年及以上相关工作经验","岗位职责：","需要有半年以上法律相关经验","工作职责：","核心职能：协助法律项目管理，自主研究法律相关新的评测方法、理论，定期产出行业观察报告。协助科技伦理项目管理，自主研究科技伦理新的数据集构建方法，理论，定期产出行业观察报告。","协作职能：其他项目协作事宜。","人员画像：（结合项目实际需求，填写必须的画像要求，无明确要求的可填“xxxx优先”或“不限”，如有特殊要求请增加备注说明）1. 会写评测分析和评测报告","2. 有数据分析、数据拆分、数据处理能力，能看懂基础代码者优先；会用设计软件/抠图软件者优先；","3. 1年及以上的大模型相关的评测工作经验，善于团队合作沟通；可独立完成多模态视频、图片评测分析","4. 抗压力强"],"skills_raw":["LLM评测","本科","法律"],"skills_norm":["LLM评测","本科","法律"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CCL1405333700J40874831105.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40781826806,"job_title":"MVA LLM Developer 奔驰虚拟助手开发工程师 ID208444","company_name":"梅赛德斯一奔驰(中国)投资有限公司","industry":"新能源/燃油整车研发制造","location":"北京 朝阳 望京","salary_min":"0","salary_max":"0","experience":"5-10年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-12 17:12:43","jd_text":"Design and develop the next-generation in-car MVA Agent architecture,including: \n- Build agentic systems with design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, and Tool Calling / Function Calling \n- Integrate LLM provider APIs and implement multi-model orchestration and routing strategies \n- Develop conversational memory services covering short-term dialogue context and long-term user profiling \n- Design and implement standardized tool-calling interfaces for vehicle capabilities \n- Perform Prompt Engineering, RAG pipeline development, and model evaluation to continuously optimize AI quality \n- Conduct unit testing, integration testing, and AI-specific evaluation (eval datasets, A/B testing) to ensure delivery quality \n- Submit and deploy code via CI/CD pipelines on Azure cloud \nDrive cross-team technical alignment and solution design as the technical owner for the Agent architecture \nProduce and maintain system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports, including: \n- Output architecture proposals for new Agent features and review them with the team lead \n- Maintain API specifications and tool-calling schemas \n- Document AI system behavior, prompt versioning, and evaluation results across the product lifecycle \nContinuous improvement of AI development methodologies and tool chains including: \n- Evaluate and adopt new LLM capabilities, Agentf rameworks, and AI coding tools (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code) \n- Monitor production performance, track AI quality metrics, and drive post-go-live optimization \n- Stay current with industry trends in LLM, Agent,and automotive AI \n• Bachelor's degree or above in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, or a related field \n• At least 3+ years of experience in LLM application development, AI Agent development, or similar AI engineering roles \n• Hands-on experience in building AI Agent systems from scratch; familiar with agentic design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, Tool Calling / Function Calling, and agent memory management \n• Familiar with at least one mainstream agent orchestration framework (e.g. LangChain / LangGraph, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, CrewAI, Semantic Kernel, or Dify / Coze) \n• Deep understanding of mainstream LLM capabilities and limitations (e.g. GPT-5, Claude, Doubao/Seed, Qwen, DeepSeek, GLM, MiniMax); experience with multi-model orchestration and routing is a plus \n• Proficient in Prompt Engineering: System Prompt design and optimization, Chain-of-Thought (CoT), Few-shot prompting, Prompt Chaining, structured output generation (JSON mode / Function Calling), and guardrails \n• Proven project experience with RAG: hands-on with vector databases (Milvus, Pinecone, Chroma, pgvector, or similar), embedding strategies, chunking strategies, hybrid search (semantic + keyword), and re-ranking \n• Experience in AI system evaluation: evaluation metric design, A/B testing for AI features, building evaluation pipelines (e.g. RAGAS or custom eval frameworks) \n• Understanding of conversational memory architectures: short-term dialogue context management and long-term user profiling / episodic memory \n• Strong Python programming ability (primary language for AI development); Go language development experience (team's main tech stack) \n• Proficient in cloud technology, especially micro-service architecture, API design, and cloud-native deployment on platforms such as Azure \n• Ability to independently produce system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports \n• Proficient in AI-assisted programming tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or Claude Code for daily development \n• Strong ownership mentality — proactively drives cross-team alignment without waiting for instructions \n• Self-driven, team-oriented, and excellent communication skills; able to simplify complex problems and decompose them into actionable tasks \nGood English communication skills, Good German language is a plus","responsibilities":["Design and develop the next-generation in-car MVA Agent architecture,including:","- Build agentic systems with design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, and Tool Calling / Function Calling","- Integrate LLM provider APIs and implement multi-model orchestration and routing strategies","- Develop conversational memory services covering short-term dialogue context and long-term user profiling","- Design and implement standardized tool-calling interfaces for vehicle capabilities","- Perform Prompt Engineering, RAG pipeline development, and model evaluation to continuously optimize AI quality","- Conduct unit testing, integration testing, and AI-specific evaluation (eval datasets, A/B testing) to ensure delivery quality","- Submit and deploy code via CI/CD pipelines on Azure cloud","Drive cross-team technical alignment and solution design as the technical owner for the Agent architecture","Produce and maintain system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports, including:","- Output architecture proposals for new Agent features and review them with the team lead","- Maintain API specifications and tool-calling schemas","- Document AI system behavior, prompt versioning, and evaluation results across the product lifecycle","Continuous improvement of AI development methodologies and tool chains including:","- Evaluate and adopt new LLM capabilities, Agentf rameworks, and AI coding tools (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code)","- Monitor production performance, track AI quality metrics, and drive post-go-live optimization","- Stay current with industry trends in LLM, Agent,and automotive AI","• Bachelor's degree or above in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, or a related field","• At least 3+ years of experience in LLM application development, AI Agent development, or similar AI engineering roles","• Hands-on experience in building AI Agent systems from scratch; familiar with agentic design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, Tool Calling / Function Calling, and agent memory management","• Familiar with at least one mainstream agent orchestration framework (e.g. LangChain / LangGraph, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, CrewAI, Semantic Kernel, or Dify / Coze)","• Deep understanding of mainstream LLM capabilities and limitations (e.g. GPT-5, Claude, Doubao/Seed, Qwen, DeepSeek, GLM, MiniMax); experience with multi-model orchestration and routing is a plus","• Proficient in Prompt Engineering: System Prompt design and optimization, Chain-of-Thought (CoT), Few-shot prompting, Prompt Chaining, structured output generation (JSON mode / Function Calling), and guardrails","• Proven project experience with RAG: hands-on with vector databases (Milvus, Pinecone, Chroma, pgvector, or similar), embedding strategies, chunking strategies, hybrid search (semantic + keyword), and re-ranking","• Experience in AI system evaluation: evaluation metric design, A/B testing for AI features, building evaluation pipelines (e.g. RAGAS or custom eval frameworks)","• Understanding of conversational memory architectures: short-term dialogue context management and long-term user profiling / episodic memory","• Strong Python programming ability (primary language for AI development); Go language development experience (team's main tech stack)","• Proficient in cloud technology, especially micro-service architecture, API design, and cloud-native deployment on platforms such as Azure","• Ability to independently produce system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports","• Proficient in AI-assisted programming tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or Claude Code for daily development","• Strong ownership mentality — proactively drives cross-team alignment without waiting for instructions","• Self-driven, team-oriented, and excellent communication skills; able to simplify complex problems and decompose them into actionable tasks","Good English communication skills, Good German language is a plus"],"requirements":["Design and develop the next-generation in-car MVA Agent architecture,including:","- Build agentic systems with design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, and Tool Calling / Function Calling","- Integrate LLM provider APIs and implement multi-model orchestration and routing strategies","- Develop conversational memory services covering short-term dialogue context and long-term user profiling","- Design and implement standardized tool-calling interfaces for vehicle capabilities","- Perform Prompt Engineering, RAG pipeline development, and model evaluation to continuously optimize AI quality","- Conduct unit testing, integration testing, and AI-specific evaluation (eval datasets, A/B testing) to ensure delivery quality","- Submit and deploy code via CI/CD pipelines on Azure cloud","Drive cross-team technical alignment and solution design as the technical owner for the Agent architecture","Produce and maintain system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports, including:","- Output architecture proposals for new Agent features and review them with the team lead","- Maintain API specifications and tool-calling schemas","- Document AI system behavior, prompt versioning, and evaluation results across the product lifecycle","Continuous improvement of AI development methodologies and tool chains including:","- Evaluate and adopt new LLM capabilities, Agentf rameworks, and AI coding tools (Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code)","- Monitor production performance, track AI quality metrics, and drive post-go-live optimization","- Stay current with industry trends in LLM, Agent,and automotive AI","• Bachelor's degree or above in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, or a related field","• At least 3+ years of experience in LLM application development, AI Agent development, or similar AI engineering roles","• Hands-on experience in building AI Agent systems from scratch; familiar with agentic design patterns such as ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, Tool Calling / Function Calling, and agent memory management","• Familiar with at least one mainstream agent orchestration framework (e.g. LangChain / LangGraph, LlamaIndex, AutoGen, CrewAI, Semantic Kernel, or Dify / Coze)","• Deep understanding of mainstream LLM capabilities and limitations (e.g. GPT-5, Claude, Doubao/Seed, Qwen, DeepSeek, GLM, MiniMax); experience with multi-model orchestration and routing is a plus","• Proficient in Prompt Engineering: System Prompt design and optimization, Chain-of-Thought (CoT), Few-shot prompting, Prompt Chaining, structured output generation (JSON mode / Function Calling), and guardrails","• Proven project experience with RAG: hands-on with vector databases (Milvus, Pinecone, Chroma, pgvector, or similar), embedding strategies, chunking strategies, hybrid search (semantic + keyword), and re-ranking","• Experience in AI system evaluation: evaluation metric design, A/B testing for AI features, building evaluation pipelines (e.g. RAGAS or custom eval frameworks)","• Understanding of conversational memory architectures: short-term dialogue context management and long-term user profiling / episodic memory","• Strong Python programming ability (primary language for AI development); Go language development experience (team's main tech stack)","• Proficient in cloud technology, especially micro-service architecture, API design, and cloud-native deployment on platforms such as Azure","• Ability to independently produce system architecture proposals, interface design documents, and technology selection reports","• Proficient in AI-assisted programming tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or Claude Code for daily development","• Strong ownership mentality — proactively drives cross-team alignment without waiting for instructions","• Self-driven, team-oriented, and excellent communication skills; able to simplify complex problems and decompose them into actionable tasks","Good English communication skills, Good German language is a plus"],"skills_raw":["开发工程师","本科","5-10年"],"skills_norm":["开发工程师","本科","5-10年"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC000614620J40781826806.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40948360115,"job_title":"中核核信-AI应用工程师（LLM与Agent业务方向）(J29248)","company_name":"同方知网（北京）技术有限公司","industry":"软件/IT服务","location":"北京 海淀 学院路","salary_min":"10001","salary_max":"20000","experience":"经验不限","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-10 10:27:19","jd_text":"一、岗位职责:\n\n 1.深入理解业务场景，将LLM与AI Agent技术应用于实际业务，优化流程、提升效率。\n\n 2.负责Prompt工程、RAG系统搭建，解决模型幻觉问题，提升业务响应准确性。\n\n 3.负责设计并实现业务型AI Agent，利用LangChain等框架构建智能工作流。\n\n 4.封装模型能力，配合后端完成业务对接，探索多模态在业务中的创新应用。\n\n \n\n 二、任职要求:\n\n 1、本科及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、自动化、工业工程等相关专业优先；\n\n 2、熟练掌握Python语言，熟悉常用库、Git及Linux环境；\n\n 3、理解Transformer及主流大模型原理；熟悉Prompt工程、RAG架构，掌握至少一种向量数据库；理解AI Agent的核心构成，了解Agent开发框架（LangChain/Dify等），能根据业务设计工作流。\n\n 4、有API调用大模型经验，了解模型部署与微调基本方法；熟悉FastAPI/Flask等Web框架者优先。\n\n 5、逻辑清晰，善于沟通协作，能主动推动技术落地业务；对新技术有热情，乐于学习分享。","responsibilities":["一、岗位职责:","1.深入理解业务场景，将LLM与AI Agent技术应用于实际业务，优化流程、提升效率。","2.负责Prompt工程、RAG系统搭建，解决模型幻觉问题，提升业务响应准确性。","3.负责设计并实现业务型AI Agent，利用LangChain等框架构建智能工作流。","4.封装模型能力，配合后端完成业务对接，探索多模态在业务中的创新应用。","二、任职要求:","1、本科及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、自动化、工业工程等相关专业优先；","2、熟练掌握Python语言，熟悉常用库、Git及Linux环境；","3、理解Transformer及主流大模型原理；熟悉Prompt工程、RAG架构，掌握至少一种向量数据库；理解AI Agent的核心构成，了解Agent开发框架（LangChain/Dify等），能根据业务设计工作流。","4、有API调用大模型经验，了解模型部署与微调基本方法；熟悉FastAPI/Flask等Web框架者优先。","5、逻辑清晰，善于沟通协作，能主动推动技术落地业务；对新技术有热情，乐于学习分享。"],"requirements":["一、岗位职责:","1.深入理解业务场景，将LLM与AI Agent技术应用于实际业务，优化流程、提升效率。","2.负责Prompt工程、RAG系统搭建，解决模型幻觉问题，提升业务响应准确性。","3.负责设计并实现业务型AI Agent，利用LangChain等框架构建智能工作流。","4.封装模型能力，配合后端完成业务对接，探索多模态在业务中的创新应用。","二、任职要求:","1、本科及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、自动化、工业工程等相关专业优先；","2、熟练掌握Python语言，熟悉常用库、Git及Linux环境；","3、理解Transformer及主流大模型原理；熟悉Prompt工程、RAG架构，掌握至少一种向量数据库；理解AI Agent的核心构成，了解Agent开发框架（LangChain/Dify等），能根据业务设计工作流。","4、有API调用大模型经验，了解模型部署与微调基本方法；熟悉FastAPI/Flask等Web框架者优先。","5、逻辑清晰，善于沟通协作，能主动推动技术落地业务；对新技术有热情，乐于学习分享。"],"skills_raw":["AGENT","本科"],"skills_norm":["AGENT","本科"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC133615290J40948360115.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.