{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40841091405,"job_title":"AI工程师-机器学习","company_name":"外企德科数字技术有限公司","industry":"软件/IT服务","location":"上海 浦东 金桥","salary_min":"15001","salary_max":"30000","experience":"1-3年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-07-06 00:28:10","jd_text":"定级定薪不卡涨幅 \n岗位职责： \n1、从事机器学习算法和理论的前沿研究工作，研究领域包括：元学习、AutoML、深度学习、强化学习、贝叶斯学习等； \n2、探索人工智能应用，构建智能系统，提供AI云服务； \n3、面向业务的AI服务化能力构建: 完成场景化的算法模块化开发、离线测试、A/B测试、模型的工程化部署和模型的持续迭代将机器学习算法落地到研发流程及产品，助力数字化转型。协同学术界/工业界专家资源，探索具备高度适应性的高能效AI算法、架构与平台 。\n\n 岗位要求\n\n 任职要求： \n1、计算机科学、机器学习、统计学、应用数学等相关专业；熟悉Linux操作系统，对常见的数据结构和算法有一定的了解 \n2、有良好的研究背景和成果，对算法研究兴趣浓厚，业务抽象能力强；具备创造性思维，能够将全新想法转化为工程应用；对研究工作充满热情，具备良好的团队合作精神和沟通能力； \n3、具备较强的编程能力，精通主流编程语言，如C/C++ /Java /Python等；能够开发基于实时数据的高性能分布式算法者优先 \n4、在高水平国际会议和学术期刊发表过相关论文，或有高水平竞赛获奖经历加分。 \n【福利待遇】： \n1、底薪(15-25k)+绩效(2-5k) (根据技术面试能力定级定薪) \n2、试用期不打折，年终奖2-4个月 \n3、入职缴纳五险一金，公积金按底薪全额缴纳 \n4、入职就有导师一对一，带教半年 \n5、优质华为研究所办公环境和技术氛围 \n6、加班费、交通报销、免费宵夜、班车、健身房、下午茶，团建，带薪年假","responsibilities":["定级定薪不卡涨幅","岗位职责：","1、从事机器学习算法和理论的前沿研究工作，研究领域包括：元学习、AutoML、深度学习、强化学习、贝叶斯学习等；","2、探索人工智能应用，构建智能系统，提供AI云服务；","3、面向业务的AI服务化能力构建: 完成场景化的算法模块化开发、离线测试、A/B测试、模型的工程化部署和模型的持续迭代将机器学习算法落地到研发流程及产品，助力数字化转型。协同学术界/工业界专家资源，探索具备高度适应性的高能效AI算法、架构与平台 。","岗位要求","任职要求：","1、计算机科学、机器学习、统计学、应用数学等相关专业；熟悉Linux操作系统，对常见的数据结构和算法有一定的了解","2、有良好的研究背景和成果，对算法研究兴趣浓厚，业务抽象能力强；具备创造性思维，能够将全新想法转化为工程应用；对研究工作充满热情，具备良好的团队合作精神和沟通能力；","3、具备较强的编程能力，精通主流编程语言，如C/C++ /Java /Python等；能够开发基于实时数据的高性能分布式算法者优先","4、在高水平国际会议和学术期刊发表过相关论文，或有高水平竞赛获奖经历加分。","【福利待遇】：","1、底薪(15-25k)+绩效(2-5k) (根据技术面试能力定级定薪)","2、试用期不打折，年终奖2-4个月","3、入职缴纳五险一金，公积金按底薪全额缴纳","4、入职就有导师一对一，带教半年","5、优质华为研究所办公环境和技术氛围","6、加班费、交通报销、免费宵夜、班车、健身房、下午茶，团建，带薪年假"],"requirements":["定级定薪不卡涨幅","岗位职责：","1、从事机器学习算法和理论的前沿研究工作，研究领域包括：元学习、AutoML、深度学习、强化学习、贝叶斯学习等；","2、探索人工智能应用，构建智能系统，提供AI云服务；","3、面向业务的AI服务化能力构建: 完成场景化的算法模块化开发、离线测试、A/B测试、模型的工程化部署和模型的持续迭代将机器学习算法落地到研发流程及产品，助力数字化转型。协同学术界/工业界专家资源，探索具备高度适应性的高能效AI算法、架构与平台 。","岗位要求","任职要求：","1、计算机科学、机器学习、统计学、应用数学等相关专业；熟悉Linux操作系统，对常见的数据结构和算法有一定的了解","2、有良好的研究背景和成果，对算法研究兴趣浓厚，业务抽象能力强；具备创造性思维，能够将全新想法转化为工程应用；对研究工作充满热情，具备良好的团队合作精神和沟通能力；","3、具备较强的编程能力，精通主流编程语言，如C/C++ /Java /Python等；能够开发基于实时数据的高性能分布式算法者优先","4、在高水平国际会议和学术期刊发表过相关论文，或有高水平竞赛获奖经历加分。","【福利待遇】：","1、底薪(15-25k)+绩效(2-5k) (根据技术面试能力定级定薪)","2、试用期不打折，年终奖2-4个月","3、入职缴纳五险一金，公积金按底薪全额缴纳","4、入职就有导师一对一，带教半年","5、优质华为研究所办公环境和技术氛围","6、加班费、交通报销、免费宵夜、班车、健身房、下午茶，团建，带薪年假"],"skills_raw":["机器视觉","图像算法","智能驾驶","Python","C++","C语言","本科","1-3年","人工智能","云计算","计算机软件","年终奖","五险一金","公积金","加班费","交通报销","班车","健身房","下午茶","团建","带薪年假","加班补助","交通补助","免费班车","免费健身","定期团建","带薪假期"],"skills_norm":["机器视觉","图像算法","智能驾驶","Python","C++","C语言","本科","1-3年","人工智能","云计算","计算机软件","年终奖","五险一金","公积金","加班费","交通报销","班车","健身房","下午茶","团建","带薪年假","加班补助","交通补助","免费班车","免费健身","定期团建","带薪假期"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CCL1480117890J40841091405.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40994226204,"job_title":"机器学习算法工程师","company_name":"九章(济南)量子科技有限公司","industry":"专用设备制造","location":"上海 浦东 康桥","salary_min":"20001","salary_max":"40000","experience":"经验不限","education":"硕士","publish_date":"2026-05-20 00:00:00","jd_text":"岗位职责：\n\n \n \n \n 负责产业中的预测类问题建模与求解 \n \n \n 应用机器学习、深度学习方法构建预测模型 \n \n \n 支持数据处理、特征工程与算法优化 \n \n \n 探索将量子计算引入机器学习流程的新方法 \n \n \n 专业背景 \n \n \n 硕士及以上，具有以下背景之一： \n \n \n 计算机科学与技术 \n \n \n 人工智能/数据科学 \n \n \n 物理学（含量子信息方向） \n \n \n \n \n \n 任职要求 \n \n \n 熟练掌握 Python、C 或 C++ 至少一门编程语言 \n \n \n 熟悉经典机器学习与深度学习框架（如 TensorFlow、PyTorch、Scikit-learn 等） \n \n \n 对预测类问题、时序建模或分类回归问题有实践经验 \n \n \n 具备数学建模能力和数据处理能力 \n \n \n 有科研/项目开发经验者优先；编程竞赛或 Kaggle 优胜者优先 \n \n\n \n \n \n 我们能提供 \n \n \n 与国际领先的量子计算科研团队共同工作机会 \n \n \n 接触前沿的量子计算实验平台与产业应用 \n \n \n 具有竞争力的薪酬和完善的科研支持 \n \n \n 助力个人在量子计算 + 算法/AI/云计算交叉领域快速成长 \n \n \n 所属单位 \n \n \n 九章（济南）量子科技有限公司 \n \n \n 由中国科学技术大学陆朝阳教授领衔的量子计算科研团队组建，团队核心成员参与“九章”系列光量子计算原型机的研发，致力于推动高维玻色子采样和光学量子计算实验平台建设及其产业应用。","responsibilities":["岗位职责：","负责产业中的预测类问题建模与求解","应用机器学习、深度学习方法构建预测模型","支持数据处理、特征工程与算法优化","探索将量子计算引入机器学习流程的新方法","专业背景","硕士及以上，具有以下背景之一：","计算机科学与技术","人工智能/数据科学","物理学（含量子信息方向）","任职要求","熟练掌握 Python、C 或 C++ 至少一门编程语言","熟悉经典机器学习与深度学习框架（如 TensorFlow、PyTorch、Scikit-learn 等）","对预测类问题、时序建模或分类回归问题有实践经验","具备数学建模能力和数据处理能力","有科研/项目开发经验者优先；编程竞赛或 Kaggle 优胜者优先","我们能提供","与国际领先的量子计算科研团队共同工作机会","接触前沿的量子计算实验平台与产业应用","具有竞争力的薪酬和完善的科研支持","助力个人在量子计算 + 算法/AI/云计算交叉领域快速成长","所属单位","九章（济南）量子科技有限公司","由中国科学技术大学陆朝阳教授领衔的量子计算科研团队组建，团队核心成员参与“九章”系列光量子计算原型机的研发，致力于推动高维玻色子采样和光学量子计算实验平台建设及其产业应用。"],"requirements":["岗位职责：","负责产业中的预测类问题建模与求解","应用机器学习、深度学习方法构建预测模型","支持数据处理、特征工程与算法优化","探索将量子计算引入机器学习流程的新方法","专业背景","硕士及以上，具有以下背景之一：","计算机科学与技术","人工智能/数据科学","物理学（含量子信息方向）","任职要求","熟练掌握 Python、C 或 C++ 至少一门编程语言","熟悉经典机器学习与深度学习框架（如 TensorFlow、PyTorch、Scikit-learn 等）","对预测类问题、时序建模或分类回归问题有实践经验","具备数学建模能力和数据处理能力","有科研/项目开发经验者优先；编程竞赛或 Kaggle 优胜者优先","我们能提供","与国际领先的量子计算科研团队共同工作机会","接触前沿的量子计算实验平台与产业应用","具有竞争力的薪酬和完善的科研支持","助力个人在量子计算 + 算法/AI/云计算交叉领域快速成长","所属单位","九章（济南）量子科技有限公司","由中国科学技术大学陆朝阳教授领衔的量子计算科研团队组建，团队核心成员参与“九章”系列光量子计算原型机的研发，致力于推动高维玻色子采样和光学量子计算实验平台建设及其产业应用。"],"skills_raw":["机器学习","Python","硕士","快速成长"],"skills_norm":["机器学习","Python","硕士","快速成长"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CCL1451204680J40994226204.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40816107807,"job_title":"AI算法工程师（机器学习/深度学习方向）(J13012)","company_name":"中芯国际集成电路制造(上海)有限公司","industry":"半导体/芯片","location":"上海 浦东 张江","salary_min":"30001","salary_max":"45000","experience":"经验不限","education":"硕士","publish_date":"2026-04-22 09:26:39","jd_text":"岗位职责:\n\n 负责机器学习、深度学习模型的设计、训练与优化，支撑智能制造、质量分析、设备预测等场景；\n\n 参与大模型（LLM）能力在制造、知识问答、文档解析等方向的应用研究与效果评估；\n\n 根据业务需求构建算法解决方案（如异常检测、预测控制、图像识别、时间序列建模等）；\n\n 参与公司级AI平台算法能力建设，沉淀模型评估与复用标准；\n\n 撰写算法方案文档，参与项目评审、需求对接与持续优化。\n\n 任职要求:\n\n 硕士及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、电子工程、自动化等相关专业；\n\n 5年及以上机器学习、深度学习算法研发经验；\n\n 精通至少一种主流深度学习框架（PyTorch等）；\n\n 熟悉常见模型与算法（Yolo、Transformer、GNN、强化学习、异常检测、聚类等）；\n\n 熟悉特征工程、模型评估、超参优化与模型压缩部署流程；\n\n 精通 Python / Java / SQL 等至少一种编程语言；\n\n 具备良好的代码规范、科研阅读与工程实现能力。\n\n 加分项：\n\n 有制造业、半导体等智能化场景落地经验；\n\n 熟悉 RAG、知识图谱、Agent、模型微调（Fine-tuning / LoRA / Distillation）等方向；\n\n 了解 MLOps、模型服务化框架（TorchServe、vLLM、Triton Inference Server 等）。","responsibilities":["岗位职责:","负责机器学习、深度学习模型的设计、训练与优化，支撑智能制造、质量分析、设备预测等场景；","参与大模型（LLM）能力在制造、知识问答、文档解析等方向的应用研究与效果评估；","根据业务需求构建算法解决方案（如异常检测、预测控制、图像识别、时间序列建模等）；","参与公司级AI平台算法能力建设，沉淀模型评估与复用标准；","撰写算法方案文档，参与项目评审、需求对接与持续优化。","任职要求:","硕士及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、电子工程、自动化等相关专业；","5年及以上机器学习、深度学习算法研发经验；","精通至少一种主流深度学习框架（PyTorch等）；","熟悉常见模型与算法（Yolo、Transformer、GNN、强化学习、异常检测、聚类等）；","熟悉特征工程、模型评估、超参优化与模型压缩部署流程；","精通 Python / Java / SQL 等至少一种编程语言；","具备良好的代码规范、科研阅读与工程实现能力。","加分项：","有制造业、半导体等智能化场景落地经验；","熟悉 RAG、知识图谱、Agent、模型微调（Fine-tuning / LoRA / Distillation）等方向；","了解 MLOps、模型服务化框架（TorchServe、vLLM、Triton Inference Server 等）。"],"requirements":["岗位职责:","负责机器学习、深度学习模型的设计、训练与优化，支撑智能制造、质量分析、设备预测等场景；","参与大模型（LLM）能力在制造、知识问答、文档解析等方向的应用研究与效果评估；","根据业务需求构建算法解决方案（如异常检测、预测控制、图像识别、时间序列建模等）；","参与公司级AI平台算法能力建设，沉淀模型评估与复用标准；","撰写算法方案文档，参与项目评审、需求对接与持续优化。","任职要求:","硕士及以上学历，计算机、人工智能、电子工程、自动化等相关专业；","5年及以上机器学习、深度学习算法研发经验；","精通至少一种主流深度学习框架（PyTorch等）；","熟悉常见模型与算法（Yolo、Transformer、GNN、强化学习、异常检测、聚类等）；","熟悉特征工程、模型评估、超参优化与模型压缩部署流程；","精通 Python / Java / SQL 等至少一种编程语言；","具备良好的代码规范、科研阅读与工程实现能力。","加分项：","有制造业、半导体等智能化场景落地经验；","熟悉 RAG、知识图谱、Agent、模型微调（Fine-tuning / LoRA / Distillation）等方向；","了解 MLOps、模型服务化框架（TorchServe、vLLM、Triton Inference Server 等）。"],"skills_raw":["深度学习","机器学习","大模型算法","硕士"],"skills_norm":["深度学习","机器学习","大模型算法","硕士"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC000439650J40816107807.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40852372314,"job_title":"机器学习工程师","company_name":"上海中智人才顾问咨询有限公司","industry":"人力资源","location":"上海 浦东 洋泾","salary_min":"20001","salary_max":"40000","experience":"3-5年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-03-31 11:38:42","jd_text":"岗位职责\n•负责机器学习算法的研究、设计与实现，涵盖分类、回归、聚类、推荐系统等核心领域\n•搭建与维护机器学习模型训练pipeline，包括数据预处理、特征工程、模型选型与训练\n•针对业务场景进行模型参数调优（Hyperparameter Tuning），持续提升模型效果与线上表现\n•跟踪大语言模型（LLM）前沿技术，负责LLM在实际业务中的应用开发与集成，包括但不限于Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning、Agent等方向\n•与产品、工程团队紧密协作，将算法能力转化为可落地的产品功能\n•撰写技术文档，进行算法方案评审和技术分享\n任职要求\n学历与经验\n•本科及以上学历（一本/211/985院校优先）计算机科学、人工智能、数学、统计学等相关专业，\n•3–5年机器学习相关工作经验；具备丰富项目经验者，3年以下亦可考虑（需提供可演示的项目成果）\n•5年以上经验者优先，薪资面议\n专业技能\n•扎实的机器学习理论基础，熟悉常见算法（如SVM、XGBoost、Random Forest、神经网络等）及其适用场景\n•熟练掌握Python，熟悉PyTorch / TensorFlow / Scikit-learn等主流ML框架\n•具备模型调优实战经验，熟悉Grid Search、Bayesian Optimization、学习率调度等调参策略\n•熟悉大语言模型的原理与应用，了解Transformer架构，具备LLM相关项目经验（如Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning等）\n•了解MLOps最佳实践，有模型部署与监控经验者优先\n加分项\n•有Kaggle竞赛获奖经历或高质量开源项目贡献\n•在机器学习、NLP、CV等领域有论文发表\n•具备分布式训练经验（如DeepSpeed、Megatron等）\n•有多模态模型（Vision-Language Model）或Agent框架开发经验","responsibilities":["岗位职责","•负责机器学习算法的研究、设计与实现，涵盖分类、回归、聚类、推荐系统等核心领域","•搭建与维护机器学习模型训练pipeline，包括数据预处理、特征工程、模型选型与训练","•针对业务场景进行模型参数调优（Hyperparameter Tuning），持续提升模型效果与线上表现","•跟踪大语言模型（LLM）前沿技术，负责LLM在实际业务中的应用开发与集成，包括但不限于Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning、Agent等方向","•与产品、工程团队紧密协作，将算法能力转化为可落地的产品功能","•撰写技术文档，进行算法方案评审和技术分享","任职要求","学历与经验","•本科及以上学历（一本/211/985院校优先）计算机科学、人工智能、数学、统计学等相关专业，","•3–5年机器学习相关工作经验；具备丰富项目经验者，3年以下亦可考虑（需提供可演示的项目成果）","•5年以上经验者优先，薪资面议","专业技能","•扎实的机器学习理论基础，熟悉常见算法（如SVM、XGBoost、Random Forest、神经网络等）及其适用场景","•熟练掌握Python，熟悉PyTorch / TensorFlow / Scikit-learn等主流ML框架","•具备模型调优实战经验，熟悉Grid Search、Bayesian Optimization、学习率调度等调参策略","•熟悉大语言模型的原理与应用，了解Transformer架构，具备LLM相关项目经验（如Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning等）","•了解MLOps最佳实践，有模型部署与监控经验者优先","加分项","•有Kaggle竞赛获奖经历或高质量开源项目贡献","•在机器学习、NLP、CV等领域有论文发表","•具备分布式训练经验（如DeepSpeed、Megatron等）","•有多模态模型（Vision-Language Model）或Agent框架开发经验"],"requirements":["岗位职责","•负责机器学习算法的研究、设计与实现，涵盖分类、回归、聚类、推荐系统等核心领域","•搭建与维护机器学习模型训练pipeline，包括数据预处理、特征工程、模型选型与训练","•针对业务场景进行模型参数调优（Hyperparameter Tuning），持续提升模型效果与线上表现","•跟踪大语言模型（LLM）前沿技术，负责LLM在实际业务中的应用开发与集成，包括但不限于Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning、Agent等方向","•与产品、工程团队紧密协作，将算法能力转化为可落地的产品功能","•撰写技术文档，进行算法方案评审和技术分享","任职要求","学历与经验","•本科及以上学历（一本/211/985院校优先）计算机科学、人工智能、数学、统计学等相关专业，","•3–5年机器学习相关工作经验；具备丰富项目经验者，3年以下亦可考虑（需提供可演示的项目成果）","•5年以上经验者优先，薪资面议","专业技能","•扎实的机器学习理论基础，熟悉常见算法（如SVM、XGBoost、Random Forest、神经网络等）及其适用场景","•熟练掌握Python，熟悉PyTorch / TensorFlow / Scikit-learn等主流ML框架","•具备模型调优实战经验，熟悉Grid Search、Bayesian Optimization、学习率调度等调参策略","•熟悉大语言模型的原理与应用，了解Transformer架构，具备LLM相关项目经验（如Prompt Engineering、RAG、Fine-tuning等）","•了解MLOps最佳实践，有模型部署与监控经验者优先","加分项","•有Kaggle竞赛获奖经历或高质量开源项目贡献","•在机器学习、NLP、CV等领域有论文发表","•具备分布式训练经验（如DeepSpeed、Megatron等）","•有多模态模型（Vision-Language Model）或Agent框架开发经验"],"skills_raw":["自然语言处理","机器视觉","搜索/推荐算法","本科","3-5年","人工智能"],"skills_norm":["自然语言处理","机器视觉","搜索/推荐算法","本科","3-5年","人工智能"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC176030620J40852372314.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40887970312,"job_title":"人工智能/机器学习工程师","company_name":"爱多邦(北京)信息技术服务有限公司","industry":"软件/IT服务","location":"上海 杨浦 新江湾城","salary_min":"15001","salary_max":"25000","experience":"5-10年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-03-24 11:50:09","jd_text":"About the Job\nNow, more than ever, Technology needs to respond quickly to turn market disruptions into opportunities for our world-class brand. To achieve this, we must continue to develop our Enterprise Analytics, Data Science & Machine Learning capabilities and team to ensure we’re maximizing the power of the Nike enterprise in the analytics/machine learning space and managing data as a competitive advantage.\nIf you’re ready to innovate and be a driving force for building solutions in Enterprise Data and Analytics organization, come join us now! You will be part of an organization that is revolutionizing Nike technology platforms and architecting a data and analytics landscape that is simplified, modern, flexible—and will ultimately enable Nike on its journey to beyond.\nKey Responsibilities\nDesign, develop, and deploy intelligent AI agents capable of autonomous reasoning, tool use, memory management, and multi-step task execution using large language models (LLMs) and multi-modal models.\nBuild and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems with advanced retrieval, re-ranking, and context fusion strategies.\nArchitect agent workflows using frameworks such as LangGraph, LangChain, DIFY, or similar orchestration platforms to support complex, stateful interactions.\nImplement robust prompt engineering, chain-of-thought prompting, and self-reflection mechanisms to enhance agent reliability and performance.\nIntegrate external tools, APIs, and enterprise data sources into agent systems to enable real-world action and decision-making.\nLeverage classical and modern NLP techniques (e.g., BERT, Transformers, instruction-tuned models) to improve understanding, generation, and grounding.\nCollaborate with product, engineering, and data teams to embed agent-powered features into Nike’s digital products and internal platforms.\nDeploy and monitor agent applications using CI/CD pipelines (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab CI), containerization (Docker), and observability best practices.\nScale AI infrastructure on public cloud platforms (AWS, Alibaba Cloud) to support low-latency, high-availability agent services.\nQualifications:\nBachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, or a related field. Master’s or Ph.D. preferred.\n3+ years of hands-on experience in AI/ML, with demonstrated expertise in LLMs, RAG, and AI agent development.\nProficiency with agent and workflow frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, DIFY, or AutoGen.\nStrong foundation in NLP and deep learning (Transformers, BERT, fine-tuning, quantization, etc.).\nExperience building search/retrieval systems with emphasis on recall, ranking, and semantic matching.\nSolid cloud engineering skills on AWS and/or Alibaba Cloud (e.g., SageMaker, ECS, Lambda, OSS).\nFamiliarity with software engineering best practices: version control (Git), testing, CI/CD, and containerization.\nAbility to prototype rapidly while maintaining production-grade code quality.\nExcellent communication skills to bridge technical implementation and business impact.\nWhy Join Us?\nOpportunity to pioneer next-generation AI agents that transform how Nike serves athletes and operates internally.\nCollaborative, innovative culture with access to cutting-edge research and real-world scale.\nFlexible, global work environment with mentorship and career growth paths in AI engineering.","responsibilities":["About the Job","Now, more than ever, Technology needs to respond quickly to turn market disruptions into opportunities for our world-class brand. To achieve this, we must continue to develop our Enterprise Analytics, Data Science & Machine Learning capabilities and team to ensure we’re maximizing the power of the Nike enterprise in the analytics/machine learning space and managing data as a competitive advantage.","If you’re ready to innovate and be a driving force for building solutions in Enterprise Data and Analytics organization, come join us now! You will be part of an organization that is revolutionizing Nike technology platforms and architecting a data and analytics landscape that is simplified, modern, flexible—and will ultimately enable Nike on its journey to beyond.","Key Responsibilities","Design, develop, and deploy intelligent AI agents capable of autonomous reasoning, tool use, memory management, and multi-step task execution using large language models (LLMs) and multi-modal models.","Build and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems with advanced retrieval, re-ranking, and context fusion strategies.","Architect agent workflows using frameworks such as LangGraph, LangChain, DIFY, or similar orchestration platforms to support complex, stateful interactions.","Implement robust prompt engineering, chain-of-thought prompting, and self-reflection mechanisms to enhance agent reliability and performance.","Integrate external tools, APIs, and enterprise data sources into agent systems to enable real-world action and decision-making.","Leverage classical and modern NLP techniques (e.g., BERT, Transformers, instruction-tuned models) to improve understanding, generation, and grounding.","Collaborate with product, engineering, and data teams to embed agent-powered features into Nike’s digital products and internal platforms.","Deploy and monitor agent applications using CI/CD pipelines (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab CI), containerization (Docker), and observability best practices.","Scale AI infrastructure on public cloud platforms (AWS, Alibaba Cloud) to support low-latency, high-availability agent services.","Qualifications:","Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, or a related field. Master’s or Ph.D. preferred.","3+ years of hands-on experience in AI/ML, with demonstrated expertise in LLMs, RAG, and AI agent development.","Proficiency with agent and workflow frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, DIFY, or AutoGen.","Strong foundation in NLP and deep learning (Transformers, BERT, fine-tuning, quantization, etc.).","Experience building search/retrieval systems with emphasis on recall, ranking, and semantic matching.","Solid cloud engineering skills on AWS and/or Alibaba Cloud (e.g., SageMaker, ECS, Lambda, OSS).","Familiarity with software engineering best practices: version control (Git), testing, CI/CD, and containerization.","Ability to prototype rapidly while maintaining production-grade code quality.","Excellent communication skills to bridge technical implementation and business impact.","Why Join Us?","Opportunity to pioneer next-generation AI agents that transform how Nike serves athletes and operates internally.","Collaborative, innovative culture with access to cutting-edge research and real-world scale.","Flexible, global work environment with mentorship and career growth paths in AI engineering."],"requirements":["About the Job","Now, more than ever, Technology needs to respond quickly to turn market disruptions into opportunities for our world-class brand. To achieve this, we must continue to develop our Enterprise Analytics, Data Science & Machine Learning capabilities and team to ensure we’re maximizing the power of the Nike enterprise in the analytics/machine learning space and managing data as a competitive advantage.","If you’re ready to innovate and be a driving force for building solutions in Enterprise Data and Analytics organization, come join us now! You will be part of an organization that is revolutionizing Nike technology platforms and architecting a data and analytics landscape that is simplified, modern, flexible—and will ultimately enable Nike on its journey to beyond.","Key Responsibilities","Design, develop, and deploy intelligent AI agents capable of autonomous reasoning, tool use, memory management, and multi-step task execution using large language models (LLMs) and multi-modal models.","Build and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems with advanced retrieval, re-ranking, and context fusion strategies.","Architect agent workflows using frameworks such as LangGraph, LangChain, DIFY, or similar orchestration platforms to support complex, stateful interactions.","Implement robust prompt engineering, chain-of-thought prompting, and self-reflection mechanisms to enhance agent reliability and performance.","Integrate external tools, APIs, and enterprise data sources into agent systems to enable real-world action and decision-making.","Leverage classical and modern NLP techniques (e.g., BERT, Transformers, instruction-tuned models) to improve understanding, generation, and grounding.","Collaborate with product, engineering, and data teams to embed agent-powered features into Nike’s digital products and internal platforms.","Deploy and monitor agent applications using CI/CD pipelines (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab CI), containerization (Docker), and observability best practices.","Scale AI infrastructure on public cloud platforms (AWS, Alibaba Cloud) to support low-latency, high-availability agent services.","Qualifications:","Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science, or a related field. Master’s or Ph.D. preferred.","3+ years of hands-on experience in AI/ML, with demonstrated expertise in LLMs, RAG, and AI agent development.","Proficiency with agent and workflow frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, DIFY, or AutoGen.","Strong foundation in NLP and deep learning (Transformers, BERT, fine-tuning, quantization, etc.).","Experience building search/retrieval systems with emphasis on recall, ranking, and semantic matching.","Solid cloud engineering skills on AWS and/or Alibaba Cloud (e.g., SageMaker, ECS, Lambda, OSS).","Familiarity with software engineering best practices: version control (Git), testing, CI/CD, and containerization.","Ability to prototype rapidly while maintaining production-grade code quality.","Excellent communication skills to bridge technical implementation and business impact.","Why Join Us?","Opportunity to pioneer next-generation AI agents that transform how Nike serves athletes and operates internally.","Collaborative, innovative culture with access to cutting-edge research and real-world scale.","Flexible, global work environment with mentorship and career growth paths in AI engineering."],"skills_raw":["自然语言处理","机器视觉","集成学习","分类回归","聚类算法","搜索/检索/知识图谱","DIFY/AUTOGEN","Python","GIT/CI/CD/容器化","AWS/阿里云","LANGGRAPH","搜索/推荐算法","AGENT 开发","C语言","本科","5-10年","AGENT /供应链","国际贸易","人工智能"],"skills_norm":["自然语言处理","机器视觉","集成学习","分类回归","聚类算法","搜索/检索/知识图谱","DIFY/AUTOGEN","Python","GIT/CI/CD/容器化","AWS/阿里云","LANGGRAPH","搜索/推荐算法","AGENT 开发","C语言","本科","5-10年","AGENT /供应链","国际贸易","人工智能"],"url":"http://www.zhaopin.com/jobdetail/CC185804120J40887970312.htm","scrape_time":"2026-07-06T08:48:50.545Z"}
{"source_type":"job_platform","source_name":"zhaopin","page":1,"job_id":40901316803,"job_title":"机器人-规控算法工程师（强化学习）","company_name":"安徽橙犀进出口有限公司","industry":"专用设备制造","location":"上海 浦东 张江","salary_min":"30001","salary_max":"55000","experience":"3-5年","education":"本科","publish_date":"2026-06-16 01:09:11","jd_text":"岗位职责\n1.负责移动机器人的运动规划、决策与控制算法的设计、开发与部署。\n2.研发并优化基于模型与数据驱动相结合的规控算法，包括但不限于：模型预测控制（MPC）、轨迹优化、行为树/状态机决策，以及强化学习（RL）策略。\n3.设计并实现基于强化学习（如模仿学习、离线/在线RL、逆强化学习）的决策与运动规划算法，解决动态、非结构化环境下的适应性控制问题。\n4.主导算法从仿真训练（Gazebo, Isaac Sim, MuJoCo等）、Sim2Real迁移到实体机器人部署的全流程，负责系统集成、参数整定与实机性能调优。\n5.与感知、建图、硬件团队紧密协作，解决多模块耦合中的实际问题，提升机器人系统的整体鲁棒性、智能性与效率。\n6.撰写核心算法文档与技术报告，跟踪并推动前沿技术（如大模型与规划结合、端到端决策）在机器人产品中的落地探索。\n任职要求\n1.本科及以上学历，机器人学、控制科学与工程、计算机、人工智能等相关专业。\n2.3年左右机器人规划控制算法研发经验，有完整的算法开发并实际部署到机器人产品的经历。\n3.具备扎实的强化学习理论基础，熟悉主流RL框架（如PyTorch, TensorFlow, RLlib, Stable-Baselines3），具有将强化学习应用于机器人决策或运动控制的实际项目经验，例如使用RL进行局部避障、多任务决策等。\n4.精通Linux下的C++/Python开发，代码结构清晰，注重性能与可维护性。\n5.熟练掌握ROS/ROS2 框架，具备机器人系统集成与调试的丰富经验。\n6.熟悉机器人常用仿真工具（Gazebo, MuJoCo, Isaac Sim, Webots等），能独立构建算法训练与验证仿真环境。\n7.有实体机器人（如移动底盘、机械臂、人形机器人等）的驱动、通信（CAN/ Ethernet）和闭环控制调试经验。","responsibilities":["岗位职责","1.负责移动机器人的运动规划、决策与控制算法的设计、开发与部署。","2.研发并优化基于模型与数据驱动相结合的规控算法，包括但不限于：模型预测控制（MPC）、轨迹优化、行为树/状态机决策，以及强化学习（RL）策略。","3.设计并实现基于强化学习（如模仿学习、离线/在线RL、逆强化学习）的决策与运动规划算法，解决动态、非结构化环境下的适应性控制问题。","4.主导算法从仿真训练（Gazebo, Isaac Sim, MuJoCo等）、Sim2Real迁移到实体机器人部署的全流程，负责系统集成、参数整定与实机性能调优。","5.与感知、建图、硬件团队紧密协作，解决多模块耦合中的实际问题，提升机器人系统的整体鲁棒性、智能性与效率。","6.撰写核心算法文档与技术报告，跟踪并推动前沿技术（如大模型与规划结合、端到端决策）在机器人产品中的落地探索。","任职要求","1.本科及以上学历，机器人学、控制科学与工程、计算机、人工智能等相关专业。","2.3年左右机器人规划控制算法研发经验，有完整的算法开发并实际部署到机器人产品的经历。","3.具备扎实的强化学习理论基础，熟悉主流RL框架（如PyTorch, TensorFlow, RLlib, Stable-Baselines3），具有将强化学习应用于机器人决策或运动控制的实际项目经验，例如使用RL进行局部避障、多任务决策等。","4.精通Linux下的C++/Python开发，代码结构清晰，注重性能与可维护性。","5.熟练掌握ROS/ROS2 框架，具备机器人系统集成与调试的丰富经验。","6.熟悉机器人常用仿真工具（Gazebo, MuJoCo, Isaac Sim, Webots等），能独立构建算法训练与验证仿真环境。","7.有实体机器人（如移动底盘、机械臂、人形机器人等）的驱动、通信（CAN/ Ethernet）和闭环控制调试经验。"],"requirements":["岗位职责","1.负责移动机器人的运动规划、决策与控制算法的设计、